	ZH 1:
	'Aah... Come to think of it,'
	R
	'there is somebody somewhere'
	R
	'that has it worse than me...'
	\L_0402c:
	ZH 1:
	'Huhuhuhu...'
	\L_0402c:
	ZH 1:
	'Well... In any case, we were in'
	R
	'fact the strongest team at the'
	R
	'time.'
	\L_0402c:
	ZH 1:
	'So we went off to slay the Demon'
	R
	'Lord.'
