	R
	'the ruins,'
	\L_0402c:
	ZH 1:
	'and when we placed them on a'
	R
	'pedestal in front of the door it'
	R
	'opened.'
	\L_0402c:
	ZH 1:
	'We entered.'
	\L_0402c:
	ZH 1:
	'It was an absurd dungeon...'
	\L_0402c:
	ZH 1:
	'Then... Beyond the door, we'
	R
	'met a god.'
